            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Not really possible with current design and implementation of `argument` textobject in 'mini.ai'.\r\n\r\nI can suggest using `sf` (`find`) functionality of 'mini.surround' to go to the right part of function call with `sff`.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Not really possible with current design and implementation of <code class=\"notranslate\">argument</code> textobject in 'mini.ai'.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I can suggest using <code class=\"notranslate\">sf</code> (<code class=\"notranslate\">find</code>) functionality of 'mini.surround' to go to the right part of function call with <code class=\"notranslate\">sff</code>.</p>",
            "bodyText": "Not really possible with current design and implementation of argument textobject in 'mini.ai'.\nI can suggest using sf (find) functionality of 'mini.surround' to go to the right part of function call with sff.",
